        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "awei",
          "text": "亿万匹拓疆的蛙~在祂滔海中奔跑~（一阵劲爆的吉他尾杀）",
          "continueKey": "dlg:concert_01:continue"
        },
        "x": 6340,
        "y": 40
      },
      "concert_02": {
        "id": "concert_02",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "喔喔喔喔喔喔！咿呀！咿呀！",
          "continueKey": "dlg:concert_02:continue"
        },
        "x": 6640,
        "y": 40
      },
      "concert_03": {
        "id": "concert_03",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "player",
          "text": "咿呀！",
          "continueKey": "dlg:concert_03:continue"
        },
        "x": 6940,
        "y": 40
      },
      "concert_04": {
        "id": "concert_04",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "awei",
          "text": "谢谢！",
          "continueKey": "dlg:concert_04:continue"
        },
        "x": 7240,
        "y": 40
      },
      "concert_05": {
        "id": "concert_05",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "awei",
          "text": "这次我要特别感谢我的一位朋友。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:concert_05:continue"
        },
        "x": 7540,
        "y": 40
      },
      "concert_06": {
        "id": "concert_06",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "那一人是谁？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:concert_06:continue"
        },
        "x": 7840,
        "y": 40
      },
      "concert_07": {
        "id": "concert_07",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "awei",
          "text": "这位朋友，在我最穷困的时候不忘鼓励我哀兵必胜，在我最辉煌的时刻也不忘提醒我骄兵必败！",
          "continueKey": "dlg:concert_07:continue"
        },
        "x": 8140,
        "y": 40
      },
      "concert_08": {
        "id": "concert_08",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "awei",
          "text": "没有这位朋友支持我努力走下去，就没有我今日的监听级发烧耳机，也没有我们即将在流媒体上架的歌曲的HiFi音质。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:concert_08:continue"
        },
        "x": 8440,
        "y": 40
      },
      "concert_09": {
        "id": "concert_09",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "awei",
          "text": "好Homie，你在我心中的地位，堪比让赛博坦陆逊反败为胜的夷陵山脉最后一道山梁，在演唱结束时，让我们为这个残酷世界里的最后一道善良，点“赞”！我们要组一辈子少年乐队！谢谢。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:concert_09:continue"
        },
        "x": 8740,
        "y": 40
      },
